@startuml
title FiscalWave — Chile SII signing and rendering (proposed / propuesto)
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "Authorized issuer / Emisor autorizado" as User
participant "Invoices MFE" as MFE
participant "Fiscal Document Service" as Fiscal
database "PostgreSQL\nfolios and idempotency" as DB
participant "Signer credential port\nPKCS#12 (.pfx/.p12)" as PFX
participant "CAF credential port\nRSASK private timbre key" as CAF
participant "Official XSD validator\nversioned offline bundle" as XSD
participant "PDF renderer\nPDF417" as PDF
folder "Private object storage\nimmutable signed XML + PDF" as Store
participant "SII Connector" as SII
User -> MFE : Issue synthetic DTE / Emitir DTE de prueba
MFE -> Fiscal : issue(idempotency key, issuer)
Fiscal -> DB : Unique issuer + type + folio; store intent
DB --> Fiscal : Authorized range reserved
Fiscal -> CAF : Obtain authorized CAF key (restricted)
CAF --> Fiscal : Temporary key access
Fiscal -> Fiscal : Construct TED (DD + FRMT)
Fiscal -> XSD : Validate document XML
XSD --> Fiscal : Schema + business checks
Fiscal -> PFX : Sign whole XML with authorized signer
PFX --> Fiscal : XMLDSig result
Fiscal -> XSD : Validate final signed document
XSD --> Fiscal : Valid or error
Fiscal -> Store : Persist immutable signed XML
Fiscal -> PDF : Render stored signed XML including TED
PDF --> Fiscal : PDF + scannable PDF417
Fiscal -> Store : Persist derived PDF
Fiscal -> DB : Audit metadata + outbox
Fiscal --> MFE : Document ID and pending status
DB -> SII : Async outbox submission command (when authorized)
note right of CAF
CAF private timbre key != PFX signer key
Never store secrets in Redis/Mongo.
end note
note right of PDF
PDF is representation, XML is
tax document; print sample tests pending.
end note
note over SII
No real submissions without
authorized issuer and SII process.
end note
@enduml
